sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Parent
  participant W as Web App
  participant API as BillingService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant PO as payOS
  P->>W: Choose plan
  W->>API: POST /payments/plans/checkout {planId}
  API->>DB: insert orders(pending, expiresAt) + order_items(snapshot price)
  API->>PO: paymentRequests.create(orderCode, amount, returnUrl)
  alt payOS error
    API->>DB: order failed
    API-->>W: 503
  end
  API-->>W: checkoutUrl
  W->>PO: Redirect, parent pays by VietQR
  PO->>API: POST /payments/payos/webhook
  API->>DB: insert webhook_logs
  API->>PO: webhooks.verify(signature)
  alt invalid signature / unknown order / amount mismatch
    API-->>PO: 200 not processed (logged)
  else valid
    API->>DB: fulfillOrder: UPDATE orders SET paid WHERE status IN (pending, expired)
    API->>DB: startPeriod: close old subscription, new active period, credit_grant
    API-->>PO: 200 processed
  end
  PO-->>W: Redirect to /parent/billing/result
  W->>API: GET /payments/orders/:id (syncs with payOS if still pending)
